            "old": "class ru.ludwigandreas.reconciliation.actuator.ReconciliationEndpoint",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. The reconciliation actuator endpoint is replaced by the reconciliation area of the administrative surface, /admin/v1/reconciliation/..., authorized by the service's ludwig.admin.grants and audited. Migration: point operator tooling at /admin/v1/reconciliation and grant reconciliation.read/operate/privileged."
        },
        {
            "code": "java.class.removed",
            "old": "class ru.ludwigandreas.reconciliation.config.ReconciliationActuatorAutoConfiguration",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. Its only bean was the removed ReconciliationEndpoint; the administrative area is registered by ReconciliationAdminAutoConfiguration. Migration: none beyond the endpoint's."
        },
        {
            "code": "java.class.removed",
            "old": "class ru.ludwigandreas.reconciliation.config.ReconciliationProperties.Endpoint",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. ludwig.reconciliation.endpoint.* configured the removed actuator endpoint, including allow-destructive-operations; whether a deployment permits the destructive actions is now whether any of its roles is granted reconciliation.privileged. Migration: delete the properties."
        },
        {
            "regex": true,
            "code": "java\\.method\\.removed",
            "old": "method ru\\.ludwigandreas\\.reconciliation\\.config\\.ReconciliationProperties\\.Endpoint ru\\.ludwigandreas\\.reconciliation\\.config\\.ReconciliationProperties::getEndpoint\\(\\)",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. The accessor of the removed ReconciliationProperties.Endpoint. Migration: delete ludwig.reconciliation.endpoint.*."
        },
        {
            "code": "java.field.removed",
