            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. Only the removed actuator endpoint emitted it; operator actions are now administrative audit events of category admin whose action is the operation id. Migration: query the audit trail by category admin instead."
        },
        {
            "regex": true,
