            "old": "field ru\\.ludwigandreas\\.reconciliation\\.audit\\.ReconciliationAuditEvent\\.Category\\..*",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. Removing Category.OPERATOR shifts the ordinal of the constants declared after it. The category is persisted and compared by name, never by ordinal. Migration: none."
        },
        {
            "code": "java.class.removed",
            "old": "class ru.ludwigandreas.ingest.actuator.FileIngestEndpoint",
            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. The file-ingest actuator endpoint is replaced by the fileingest area of the administrative surface, /admin/v1/fileingest/..., authorized by ludwig.admin.grants and audited. Migration: point operator tooling at /admin/v1/fileingest and grant fileingest.read/operate."
        },
        {
            "code": "java.class.removed",
            "old": "class ru.ludwigandreas.ingest.autoconfigure.FileIngestActuatorAutoConfiguration",
