            "justification": "REMOVED IN THE NEXT MAJOR RELEASE WITHOUT A PRIOR DEPRECATION, BY THE OWNER'S EXPLICIT DECISION - change starter-admin-endpoints. The accessor of the removed FileIngestProperties.Endpoint. Migration: delete ludwig.ingest.endpoint.*."
        },
